# The driver of experiments/lammps/run.sh: LAMMPS's examples/melt input (3d Lennard-Jones,
# 4000 atoms on an fcc lattice) without its integrator and output, with one random
# displacement of every atom by up to 3 lattice units in each direction, which migrates atoms
# between all subdomains in both directions through Irregular::migrate_atoms
units		lj
atom_style	atomic
lattice		fcc 0.8442
region		box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box	1 box
create_atoms	1 box
mass		1 1.0
velocity	all create 1.0 87287
pair_style	lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff	1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
displace_atoms	all random 3.0 3.0 3.0 4927
run		10
